<section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">02 / PACKAGE MANAGEMENT</p>
    <h1>Emerald</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        Emerald is Vylen's ports-backed package manager. It resolves port
        metadata from configured repositories, builds packages, tracks installed
        files and dependencies, and exposes inspection tools for maintaining a
        small system.
    </p>

    <div class="command-line"># emerald &lt;command&gt; [arguments] [options]</div>
</section>

